Z||000000||Chris Schaefer||09-07-2000||07:08 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">REMINDER.<P>The Fiero Owners Club of New England is holding their Annual Fall Fiero Car Show.<P>SHOW DATE is SEPTEMBER 23, 2000<BR>Location is - The Rutland Community Center in Rutland, Massachusetts<BR>Be on site at 8:30am to begin the day of fun.<P>Schedule for the day is as follows; <BR>Show start times -- 8:30am at the Rutland Community Center<P>Lunch -- Pizza delivery from Tulla's Pizza in Rutland as in past years -- order and pay during show registration, date of show.<P>Show End Time -- 1:00pm<BR>Awards Ceremony ends time -- 1:45pm<P>Between 1:45pm - 2:00pm -- We cruise to Connecticut to visit Bob Parker's Kick Hill Farm.<P>Everyone is free to leave Bob's at any time.  Of course you must first acquire a few trinkets from Bob.  So be sure to bring lots of cash.  You never can tell what you will need.<P>Dinner -- Bob and family serving hot-dogs and.... at Kick Hill farm.<P>Pre-registrations must be mailed to Tim Perrigo by September 10th.  Show entry fee is $7.00 with a $3.00 late fee after September 10th.<P>If you would like a application form you may E-Mail me ( cj_schaefer@snet.net ) and I will send one to you.  You may also just send a check payable to Tim Perrigo at the address below with the following Info.<P>Your Name, Address, Phone#, E-Mail Address, Year, Model & Body Style, Color, ENGINE & Transmission, Roof Type and any Modifications.<P>	Tim Perrigo<BR>	1 Fiero Drive<BR>	OOB, ME 04064<P>Please send in your entry fee early and let’s make it a GREAT DAY! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Thank you for your Time. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||10
