Z||000012||Chris Schaefer||09-08-2000||07:32 PM||||Everyone,<P>Thank you for all your responces.<P>Larry,  Try to do what you can to get Fran to go.  I talked to him a few weeks back.  Fran seemed very positive at that time.  Do what you can to make sure he comes.<P>Eric,  I know what you are going through with your project.  Enjoy all the good and the bad of it.  Also you are always welcome to come even if your car is off the road.<P>Phil,  Here you go.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>87C805 there is always next year.  Old Orchard Beach in the late Spring and Rutland in the Fall.  Plus many others as you know.<P>TheFiero64 see you there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||14
