Z||000026||fieroparts.com||09-10-2000||10:00 PM||||Hi,<P>This will be our 6th year in Rutland MA<BR>Our fall shows have alway been able to draw<BR>a large number of cars, we are at this rate<BR>expecting over 50 Fieros. This is your chance to meet some new people and see some of the nices and coolest Fieros around.  Over the past 6 years, we have had shows every year and Mike Valentine from Denver CO. has made it out here twice, and is coming to this years show, Now that's a die hard Fiero fan.  So shine up your wheels<BR>and I will see all of you on the 23rd in<BR>Rutland MA.<P>Tim <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/88coupe1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/88coupe1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/88coupe3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/88coupe3.jpg</A> <P> <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/hud2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/hud2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/hud3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/hud3.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/lumbar1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/mods/lumbar1.jpg</A> <BR>||||reg||1
