Z||000029||lou_dias||09-11-2000||11:54 PM||||I don't think I'll be able to make the show, but I'll be racing my GT at Seekonk Speedway the next afternoon.  I highly recommend a strong Fiero entry in this race, especially you guys with V8's, turbo's and SC's.  I have a 3.4 in mine and I could have taken second place on the Sunday before Labor Day had I had the inside lane against the car that did take second place but beat me by a length in round 2.  It's alot of fun.  You get to smoke lots of Firebirds, Camaros, Mustangs and Ricecakes.  there is usually a really fast Eclipse or 2 that get pretty far.  And you've got to see the Camaro that always wins.  I'd like to see that engine.  By the way, it's an oval track incase you've never been there.||||reg||1
